ds\",\"kind\",\"instructions\"],\"title\":\"PreparationPlanItem\",\"type\":\"object\"}},\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"action\":{\"enum\":[\"query\",\"finish\"],\"title\":\"Action\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"items\":{\"items\":{\"discriminator\":{\"mapping\":{\"dependency\":\"#/$defs/FormalCasePlanItem\",\"prepare\":\"#/$defs/PreparationPlanItem\",\"target\":\"#/$defs/FormalCasePlanItem\"},\"propertyName\":\"kind\"},\"oneOf\":[{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/FormalCasePlanItem\"},{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/PreparationPlanItem\"}]},\"maxItems\":200,\"title\":\"Items\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"queries\":{\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/PlanningQuery\"},\"maxItems\":8,\"title\":\"Queries\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"summary\":{\"maxLength\":4000,\"minLength\":1,\"title\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"unresolved\":{\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/PlanningGap\"},\"maxItems\":200,\"title\":\"Unresolved\",\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"action\",\"summary\"],\"title\":\"PlanningDecision\",\"type\":\"object\"}\n准备范围：有可靠清理依据的prepare明确填写cleanup_sources，引用本计划产生待清理数据或条件的来源key。它不能引用自身或另一个清理项。依据不足时保留unresolved，不猜测清理操作。服务端会依照原计划中的正式消费者补齐清理依赖，再冻结排序和归属；prepare的instructions仍需保存实际操作与验证要求。此范围仅说明计划，不能报告实际对象已创建或已清理。",
